    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this lovely three-bedroom / two-bathroom semi-detached family home to the market tucked away in Sundale Park, Tallaght, Dublin 24. Sundale Park is enviably positioned within arm's reach of a variety of essential amenities including convenience stores, extensive leisure & sports facilities, primary & secondary schools. On its doorstep you will find Citywest Shopping Centre, plentiful bus routes, the Naas Road & The Luas, you are also only a short 10 minutes' drive to Tallaght Square and Village.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of 80 sqm consists of entrance hallway, living room with fireplace & bay window and fully fitted kitchen/dining area to the rear. On the first floor you have three generous bedrooms (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. To the rear of the property you have a fully enclosed garden which comes of the lowest maintenance whilst the front offers plenty of off-street parking on another low maintenance garden.\r\n\r\nNo. 46 comes to the market as a blank canvas with no onward chain, it is need of some modernisation throughout but has the potential to be a superb family home and has plenty of additional features such as, generous sized rooms, gas fired central heating, ample storage and double-glazed windows to name but a few. The location here will be hard bet and we expect a lot of interest from first time buyers looking to get on the property ladder but equally as popular with investors looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to arrange a viewing here.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 80 sqm\r\n- BER C\r\n- 3 Bed / 2 Bath\r\n- Semi-detached family home\r\n- Good condition throughout\r\n- Generous sized living space\r\n- Bright and airy living accommodation\r\n- Entrance hallway\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Open plan kitchen/dining area\r\n- Living room with feature fireplace & bay window\r\n- Three generous bedrooms\r\n- Built in wardrobes\r\n- Master ensuite\r\n- Main family bathroom\r\n- Double glazed windows throughout\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Low maintenance rear garden\r\n- Private and fully enclosed\r\n- Low maintenance garden to the front\r\n- Ample parking to front\r\n- Exclusive & sought-after development\r\n- Within arm's reach of The Luas\r\n- Within a short stroll of Citywest Shopping Centre\r\n- Prime for first time buyers & investors\r\n\r\nDirections: D24 H9CD"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 3"
      }
